  "SCOPE": "valid for PER-PARTICLE observables of a single molecule's trajectory, which is exactly the class \u00a79 registered. For a joint observable of all N molecules the union bound gives N * E[R] > 1 and is vacuous, so no certified statement is made there.",
  "WHY_IT_IS_NOT_A_PER_PARTICLE_THINNING": "acceptance is min(movers, dest_free) per CELL, so when the cap bites it truncates a whole batch. The refused hops are not an independent thinning of individual molecules and cannot be absorbed into an effective q; that is why the kernel status is CONDITIONAL_EXACT and not EXACT."
